WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Valve spring retainer
What it does: Transfers spring force to the valve through the two retaining keepers.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Valve spring retainer
How it works: The keepers lock it to the stem.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Valve spring retainer
How it moves: Travels with the valve, compressing or releasing the spring.
